  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Feels a bit like shouting into the void at this point, but vrchat used to be a UGC-focused platform.\n\nLately, more and more features have been added that don't let us create our own content, going against the whole point of why many people play.\n\nWe should not be limited to a handful of vrchat-selected creators and forced to buy their content through the marketplace, EVERYBODY should be able to make their own content. \n\nThis also goes for portals, drones, items, and every other anti-UGC feature that has been added recently.\n\nIf your content in your shop is so good, you shouldn't be afraid of a little competition from the commumity.",
